00:14:06,901 --> 00:14:12,340
The Velocipede, or pedal bicycle, had been invented in 1861.

244
00:14:12,341 --> 00:14:15,680
It quickly became all the rage of the French aristocracy, who

245
00:14:15,681 --> 00:14:19,580
